{
"file": 992,
"paths": [
"d008/d123/f020"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "38ba64c9",
"en_raw": "There, there!"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "d16678ad",
"en_raw": "...Could that be her?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "89f5b86b",
"en_raw": "What's that"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "a9ee60dc",
"en_raw": "She's barefoot..."
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "5daf733c",
"en_raw": "She really isn't normal"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "e4d3100b",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "21ecb0e5",
"en_raw": "Maybe we should go back..."
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "91e67413",
"en_raw": "Shut up"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "e15658ec",
"en_raw": "Be quiet"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "59eb7edf",
"en_raw": "I hate dogs..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "59eb7edf",
"en_raw": "I hate dogs..."
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "11db580d",
"en_raw": "Dogs with servile eyes"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "0c77112e",
"en_raw": "that just wait"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "aef82b89",
"en_raw": "for their master's food..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "fafd0410",
"en_raw": "............"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "0f97301f",
"en_raw": "Hey"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "fafd0410",
"en_raw": "............"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "0f97301f",
"en_raw": "Hey"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "fafd0410",
"en_raw": "............"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "6885580d",
"en_raw": "Can you hear me?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "fafd0410",
"en_raw": "............"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "d180ee99",
"en_raw": "Ex-cuse me!!!"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "5279b392",
"en_raw": "Um, what are you"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "60911f6f",
"en_raw": "doing in a place like this?"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "a95d77a3",
"en_raw": "Watching the river"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "d989bbb9",
"en_raw": "Some adults have time on their hands"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "2f3553f1",
"en_raw": "in this recession-hit Japan..."
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "fafd0410",
"en_raw": "............"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "ee4193da",
"en_raw": "Oh well"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "1904dd77",
"en_raw": "It has nothing to do with me..."
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "687334a6",
"en_raw": "There are times you're so sad"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "934fca2c",
"en_raw": "you can't even cry"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "dcb2d15a",
"en_raw": "You probably don't understand"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "0bcef8cd",
"en_raw": "but I have those times..."
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "9852db5f",
"en_raw": "I understand that painfully well"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "3e6277a8",
"en_raw": "I too, at times like that"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "1838f5c5",
"en_raw": "have them"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "ca85eca5",
"en_raw": "But it couldn't be helped"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "78d7262a",
"en_raw": "In the end"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "9ddf81b6",
"en_raw": "it was an unwanted life..."
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "383a3ac2",
"en_raw": "There's no atoning for it"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "2ac07694",
"en_raw": "I know that"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "490f216e",
"en_raw": "But..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "b1462de7",
"en_raw": "This is all"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "fee8e672",
"en_raw": "I can do..."
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "8ad18ee1",
"en_raw": "Are you still here?"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "db78136f",
"en_raw": "Muddy water, a dirty river"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "3fc32d16",
"en_raw": "just like me..."
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "4dc5b469",
"en_raw": "Look"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "07458c23",
"en_raw": "Even so, the waterbirds come"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "a3ee0783",
"en_raw": "like those men..."
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "bb6e5796",
"en_raw": "Why not go home already?"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "03942332",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "e085c590",
"en_raw": "Leave me alone..."
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "0366ad79",
"en_raw": "Well, it's none of my business"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "1a732da0",
"en_raw": "...Nothing's appearing"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "8e897869",
"en_raw": "the place Segawa mentioned"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "3202bb43",
"en_raw": "I thought it was here..."
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "7112267e",
"en_raw": "Probably"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "9148a2e3",
"en_raw": "you just saw something wrong"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "30ac6ba0",
"en_raw": "I'll wait a bit"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "eb342af9",
"en_raw": "Wait / Waste of time  Well, I came all this way"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "8c0f056a",
"en_raw": "watching the sunset isn't bad"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "e50927d0",
"en_raw": "I'm not quite"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "099f5ea8",
"en_raw": "that idle"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "5f4018de",
"en_raw": "Hmm"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "b27b1ac4",
"en_raw": "that man"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "f3d7562c",
"en_raw": "She doesn't come every day..."
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "14cb7a51",
"en_raw": "Well, talking to her"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "955445a8",
"en_raw": "wouldn't gain anything"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "fafd0410",
"en_raw": "............"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "0f97301f",
"en_raw": "Hey"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "fafd0410",
"en_raw": "............"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "0f97301f",
"en_raw": "Hey"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "fafd0410",
"en_raw": "............"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "bca2788a",
"en_raw": "I'd like to ask something"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "113a8384",
"en_raw": "What time is it now?"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "a1783c3a",
"en_raw": "Well..."
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "31e9d8e5",
"en_raw": "The sun's about to set..."
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "63891158",
"en_raw": "Mom and Dad"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "8f72bc15",
"en_raw": "are probably still working"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "3ce1869d",
"en_raw": "My parents both work"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "db74998f",
"en_raw": "so it's pretty hard"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "c1aa2a15",
"en_raw": "as a middle schooler"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "0ff24ec9",
"en_raw": "Right..."
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "c6f63e2a",
"en_raw": "...I thought"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "c09c8bd2",
"en_raw": "you can live just by"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "d1797573",
"en_raw": "watching the river every day, so why"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "236691b4",
"en_raw": "would any adult think"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "7cacc58a",
"en_raw": "they're unhappy"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "2d4592e7",
"en_raw": "Right..."
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "a26aa642",
"en_raw": "...Do you realize"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "4d19f84b",
"en_raw": "I'm talking about you?"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "806f987c",
"en_raw": "Children can't understand"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "66e9f6ee",
"en_raw": "this wound, this pain..."
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "c078fbe9",
"en_raw": "...Kid! She's back"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "85c41745",
"en_raw": "Those filthy waterbirds are here again"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "84e8d909",
"en_raw": "Every time that bird comes"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "37cbae06",
"en_raw": "I become more unhappy"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "694e7ab3",
"en_raw": "You're not listening at all"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "04bafce4",
"en_raw": "...Hey, lady!"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "c9a0b06c",
"en_raw": "Sango, stop it"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "02d9957e",
"en_raw": "That's rude!"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "1920baf9",
"en_raw": " "
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "796dab3b",
"en_raw": "It's a waste of time"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "e820a093",
"en_raw": "dealing with a person like this"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "321be1fb",
"en_raw": "I won't stop!"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "3b3e135c",
"en_raw": "me"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "357855e1",
"en_raw": "I read in a book"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "69c8f1a7",
"en_raw": "that if humans increase more"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "0726c7cb",
"en_raw": "the Earth is in danger"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "ea0976d7",
"en_raw": "Even so"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "7bea5805",
"en_raw": "even if you say that"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "5eced844",
"en_raw": "there's something I definitely want to do"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "32b2b830",
"en_raw": "I have a reason to live"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "e90c2d89",
"en_raw": "But how can someone so unhappy"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "385ece4b",
"en_raw": "who wants to do nothing"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "e0d9a5aa",
"en_raw": "go on living"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "e0f5d118",
"en_raw": "The Earth's future"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "53b045bc",
"en_raw": "isn't that bright"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "6b858bf3",
"en_raw": "One person's unhappiness"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "af131526",
"en_raw": "can't be that heavy"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "3e1f403a",
"en_raw": "...Now I"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "eee7123a",
"en_raw": "understand why I'm angry"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "8e2d4ff5",
"en_raw": "..............."
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "1c20c766",
"en_raw": "Ah, no good!"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "3d641077",
"en_raw": "It still pisses me off!!"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "1bffa933",
"en_raw": "...Hey, tell me"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "3f867631",
"en_raw": "why must I be told"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "2458bd9b",
"en_raw": "things like that?"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "a40af018",
"en_raw": "Who are you? Whose kid?"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "9cf0ec77",
"en_raw": "You know nothing..."
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "c4d2cd52",
"en_raw": "Answer me properly..."
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "016f19aa",
"en_raw": "I want an answer"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "5e598d10",
"en_raw": "Please..."
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "5b0f852d",
"en_raw": "It's true I don't know"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "63d642c7",
"en_raw": "and don't want to know"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "a075be11",
"en_raw": "such a petty story!"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "cc0e9e3f",
"en_raw": "How cruel..."
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "088644e3",
"en_raw": "Why does everyone"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "3d511075",
"en_raw": "only hurt me?"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "c2cf524e",
"en_raw": "Answer me properly..."
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "c2cf524e",
"en_raw": "Answer me properly..."
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "d1de474a",
"en_raw": "You're an adult"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "c5ee04e5",
"en_raw": "stop being so dependent!"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "a48d1a1d",
"en_raw": "I'm not dependent!"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "cd22bfa5",
"en_raw": "You're just a brat!"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "c0a7701a",
"en_raw": "Saying only what you want"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "42efaeb6",
"en_raw": "where are you going!"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "ae753af4",
"en_raw": "I have things"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "16a5f38a",
"en_raw": "to say too!"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "4007c259",
"en_raw": "Me too"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "e87a67d7",
"en_raw": "Even I..."
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "5004c93c",
"en_raw": "Me too, you know"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "63b7811a",
"en_raw": "I'm furious!"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "7a405472",
"en_raw": "That's it, that's right"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "a7d9fbc8",
"en_raw": "I'll sue that guy!"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "e572d545",
"en_raw": "At this hour"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "cddcb615",
"en_raw": "he must still be at that woman's house"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "45e79793",
"en_raw": "He thinks"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "a1950aa9",
"en_raw": "I gave up"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "d59123fe",
"en_raw": "but I'm not"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "8b4d3c67",
"en_raw": "dead yet!"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "ce5fea88",
"en_raw": "I'll never forgive him!"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "2c7b7b11",
"en_raw": "I'll go take back"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "b26e8dff",
"en_raw": "my future!"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "57eb5010",
"en_raw": "...She left"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "838335c6",
"en_raw": "I still really want"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "9e3c960c",
"en_raw": "to say one thing to you"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "4cad35bc",
"en_raw": "May I?"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "7d37a013",
"en_raw": "There are sad times"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "69fb0f59",
"en_raw": "as if my heart had died"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "0409957b",
"en_raw": "sad enough that I can't even cry..."
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "08190dfe",
"en_raw": "...I understand"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "86ce6376",
"en_raw": "painfully well"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "cdb1f9ba",
"en_raw": "But..."
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "689bcb09",
"en_raw": "...It never goes back"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "3078242b",
"en_raw": "I'm the one who broke it, though..."
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "76eaf5c5",
"en_raw": "But it couldn't be helped"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "cb546486",
"en_raw": "If time had gone on like that"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "6eb6de2d",
"en_raw": "unhappiness would only multiply"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "f3c18939",
"en_raw": "There's no atoning"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "2c222081",
"en_raw": "It never goes back..."
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "97c367fd",
"en_raw": "...Now"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "1ae93df2",
"en_raw": "this is all I can do"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "bc2743a7",
"en_raw": "Standing here"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "566b03a1",
"en_raw": "like this, that's all..."
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "771f9015",
"en_raw": "...Listen"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "e1ab9249",
"en_raw": "Muddy water, a dirty river"
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "624b8cb8",
"en_raw": "just like me..."
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "4dc5b469",
"en_raw": "Look"
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "c9ed77e0",
"en_raw": "Even so, the waterbirds come"
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "9054087b",
"en_raw": "seeking food..."
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "cc6f7945",
"en_raw": "like that man..."
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "7f437e10",
"en_raw": "I'm not dependent!"
},
{
"n": 198,
"h": "c613aa36",
"en_raw": "You're just a brat..."
},
{
"n": 199,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 200,
"h": "2f78ee8b",
"en_raw": "On a humiliating bed..."
},
{
"n": 201,
"h": "4a7417c2",
"en_raw": "no one came for me..."
},
{
"n": 202,
"h": "39aeb302",
"en_raw": "all alone..."
},
{
"n": 203,
"h": "76b67ede",
"en_raw": "No way..."
},
{
"n": 204,
"h": "9b6f80de",
"en_raw": "The pain too! The despair too!"
},
{
"n": 205,
"h": "1cdb1b62",
"en_raw": "The loss too!"
},
{
"n": 206,
"h": "9b1f3b6d",
"en_raw": "You know nothing!"
},
{
"n": 207,
"h": "fec8d18c",
"en_raw": "I don't like doing this"
},
{
"n": 208,
"h": "5cd8224f",
"en_raw": "either!"
},
{
"n": 209,
"h": "3cf20774",
"en_raw": "If only he'd taken responsibility"
},
{
"n": 210,
"h": "364f2217",
"en_raw": "and married me..."
},
{
"n": 211,
"h": "4808d09d",
"en_raw": "That's right, that guy..."
},
{
"n": 212,
"h": "e0d92b62",
"en_raw": "If only he'd taken responsibility"
},
{
"n": 213,
"h": "cd655c09",
